Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 05:51:45 2026 +1100

    CI: run the magnum and NFV scenarios.
    
    Kolla builds the designate, magnum, trove, tacker, mistral and
    barbican images, but no job a Kolla change triggers deploys them,
    so a change that breaks them at runtime passes check. Add templates
    running the matching Kolla-Ansible scenarios when those images change.
    
    The Kolla-Ansible jobs are already non-voting, so this adds coverage
    without adding gate risk.
    
    Prompt: Michael asked which images Kolla-Ansible deploys that Kolla's
    own CI never exercises. These are the images that no Kolla scenario
    deploys.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5
    
    Change-Id: I1ef5bf13c5a3f1085eb0e07e9ff5f81cb8a25d58
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

